        <div class="card">
          <h2>Start Here</h2>
          <p>If you work items, open the Doer Dashboard inside the WorkApp where the work lives.</p>
          <div class="cardsGrid">
            <a class="card" href="#" onclick="switchPage('pp');setSub('pp','doer');return false;">
              <h2>Product &amp; Portfolio • Doer</h2>
              <p>Epics, Features, Stories, Requirements.</p>
              <span class="badge info">My Assigned Work</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="#" onclick="switchPage('dd');setSub('dd','doer');return false;">
              <h2>DevOps &amp; Delivery • Doer</h2>
              <p>Sprints, Bugs, QA/UAT, Release tasks.</p>
              <span class="badge info">My Sprint + Tests</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="#" onclick="switchPage('rv');setSub('rv','doer');return false;">
              <h2>Run &amp; Vendor Ops • Doer</h2>
              <p>SRs, Issues/Incidents, Renewals.</p>
              <span class="badge info">My SRs + SLAs</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="#" onclick="switchPage('gr');setSub('gr','doer');return false;">
              <h2>Governance • Doer</h2>
              <p>Approvals, reporting actions, decisions.</p>
              <span class="badge info">My Approvals</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="callout" style="margin-top:14px">
            <div class="ico">✅</div>
            <div>
              <b>Publishing tip</b>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45">
                Put <b>Doer Dashboard</b> as page #1 in each WorkApp role. Users land on “what’s on me” instantly.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>Enterprise Snapshot (demo)</h2>
          <div class="miniChart">
            <div class="barRow"><div class="barLbl">My Open (PP)</div><div class="bar"><i style="width:62%"></i></div><div class="barVal">18</div></div>
            <div class="barRow"><div class="barLbl">My Open (DevOps)</div><div class="bar"><i style="width:54%"></i></div><div class="barVal">12</div></div>
            <div class="barRow"><div class="barLbl">My Open (Run)</div><div class="bar"><i style="width:40%"></i></div><div class="barVal">9</div></div>
            <div class="barRow"><div class="barLbl">My Open (Gov)</div><div class="bar"><i style="width:22%"></i></div><div class="barVal">3</div></div>
          </div>
          <p style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)">In Smartsheet, you’ll build these as separate Doer Dashboards per WorkApp (more reliable than one global view).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRODUCT & PORTFOLIO -->
