                  Only include PP sheets (Epics/Features/Stories/Requirements) so “My Work” stays accurate.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid c2" style="margin-top:14px">
          <div class="card">
            <h2>Due Soon</h2>
            <table class="table">
